Endless development & combat!","detailedDescription":"A troop-clash strategy game. Choose your hero, command minions, crush enemy formations! Inspired by Heroes of Might & Magic and Hero's Hour. Multiple races with national styles like Huaxia and France. Random maps = unique fun every game! Endless development & combat!  \n\nRecruit legendary heroes with unique skills and distinct personalities! Each hero possesses powerful, unique abilities and growth paths. As the soul of your civilization, they lead the era, and their decisions profoundly impact the rise and fall of your empire.\n\nMeticulously forge your extraordinary legion! From indestructible heavy infantry to agile arcane archers, and awe-inspiring siege behemoths, strategically combine hundreds of unique troop types. Activate powerful bonds and tactical synergies to overcome foes in ever-shifting battles.\n\nConquer every inch of land brimming with magic and secrets! Explore a vast, procedurally generated world. Encounter wonders holding ancient power, resource-rich strategic locations, and perilous magical terrains. Adapt your expansion strategy to the land and turn the environment into a battlefield advantage!\n\nUnlock lost knowledge within the Pact Tome to propel your civilization forward! Like Civs tech/culture trees, by studying powerful magic schools, mystical rituals, and strategic doctrines, unlock revolutionary new units, buildings, and empire abilities, shaping your unique path to a magical civilization!","aboutGame":null},"vi":{"status":"pending_translation","provider":null,"shortDescription":null,"detailedDescription":null,"aboutGame":null}},"media":{"images":[{"role":"header","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/cb183121ee5bea3ea0972a2bb4b756144a81f8da/header.jpg?t=1754712211"},{"role":"capsule","url":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3846190/eeea90a8c14d18e7562d7ad74892be259406cb33/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754712211"}